style=\"color:#000\"> addition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">description </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> logFile</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> open </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;wt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> blocking </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  cannot open file </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Mplus Run Models.log&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Permission</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> denied<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Execution</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> halted</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>This is running on Ubuntu Server 16.04 LTS (HVM), R version 3.4.4, and Mplus 8.1. </div><div><br></div><div>Any help is much appreciated!</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you!</div><div><br></div><div>Morgan DeBusk-Lane</div></div>"
